{"id":"msg_m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_nyanyaparadise","label":"Cats make the world go 'round. · Group"},"label":"3. Nero has invited Admi to join the group.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_nyanyaparadise_02","next":"msg_m_ex_nyanyaparadise_04","speakers":{"nero":"Nero","admi":"Admi","biscuit":"Biscuit","leona":"Leona"},"icons":{"nero":"si_c380_00_s","admi":"si_c172_00_s","biscuit":"si_c381_00_s","leona":"si_c382_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"msg_m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_unlock","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"text":"Unlocks: Clear event stage 102210110 · After Cats make the world go 'round. chat 2. Apparently, Ruru decided to finally come to th…","key":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_1","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_1","text":"Nero has invited Admi to join the group.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"nero","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_2","text":"Hello.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_3","text":"Hey","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_4","text":"Everyone","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_5","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_5","text":"Admi?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_6","text":"I told Nero that I want to hear about Ruru,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_7","text":"and she invited me here.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_8","text":"Welcome!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_9","text":"If you want somewhere to talk about Ruru, then you've come to the right place.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_10","text":"Ruru's just about all we talk about here.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_11","text":"I like talking about cats, too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_12","text":"Ruru is so adorable.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_13","text":"But...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_14","text":"Ah, never mind.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_15","text":"You realize that the quickest way to upset someone is starting a sentence and not finishing it, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_16","text":"Oh, jeez! The last thing I want to do is to make anyone upset.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_17","text":"Don't worry, I'm not actually angry.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_18","text":"Good.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_19","text":"Anyway, is Ruru okay?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_20","text":"When I bumped into her at the toy store,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_21","text":"she didn't seem to be doing too well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_22","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_23","text":"Nero, you didn't tell her?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"nero","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_24","text":"I figured it would only make her worry, so I didn't tell her.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_25","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"nero","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_26","text":"Ruru...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"nero","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_27","text":"Her health isn't the greatest right now.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"nero","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_28","text":"We're pretty much concentrating on palliative care at this point.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_29","text":"What?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_30","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_30","text":"Admi doesn't send any more messages for a while.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_31","text":"Admi, are you okay?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_32","text":"I...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_33","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_34","text":"Um...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_35","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_36","text":"I'm sorry for asking.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"nero","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_37","text":"It's okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_38","text":"Now I'm super bummed.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_39","text":"I should have pet her more when I saw her today.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_40","text":"Ruru will always be at the shelter, so come any time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_41","text":"Yeah, you're more than welcome U^ᴥ^U","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_42","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"admi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_nyanyaparadise_03_43","text":"I will.","jump":null}],"chat":true}